$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 1-(benzylcarbamoyl)-2-(benzyloxy)ethyl benzoate (21)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 11(58mg, 0.5
mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (64 mg, 0.53 mmol, 1.05 equiv),
aldehyde 6 (79 mg, 84 μL, 0.53 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and 20 mol % of catalyst
4 in CH2Cl2was stirred for 24 hrs. After removal of solvent followed by
silica gel chromatography, 21 (173 mg, 89%) was obtained as a
brownish-white solid. Data for 21: 1H NMR: (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.12 (d, J
= 8 Hz,2H, aryl); 8.06 (dd, J = 1.2 Hz, 2H, aryl); 7.64-7.58 (m, 4H,
aryl); 7.51-7.45 (m, 4H, aryl); 7.35-7.28 (m, 3H, aryl); 6.60 (bt, 1H,
NH); 5.67 (t, J = 4.0, 1H, CH); 4.64-4.59 (dd, 1H, J = 6.4, 15.2 Hz, 1H,
CH2); 4.60 (s, 2H, CH2); 4.48-4.43 (dd, J = 5.2, 16 Hz, 1H, CH2);
4.11-4.07 (dd, J = 4.4, 10.8 Hz, 1H, CH2); 3.98-3.94 (dd, J = 3.6, 10.4
Hz, 1H, CH2) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.2, 165.5, 1378.7, 128.0,
127.9, 127.7, 73.9, 73.7, 69.7, 43.59, 137.8, 134.0, 130.5, 130.1, 129.1,
128.9, 128.9, IR: (neat) νmax = 1723, 1691, 1452, 1265, 710 cm-1 TLC:Rf =
0.29 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2) HRMS: EIMS calculated for C24H23NO4+ [M+ H]+:
390.1706, found: 390.1700 HPLC: (+/−)-21 tR 24.8 min (49.3%); tR 28.0 min
(50.7 %) (+)-21 tR 24.2 min (96.6%); tR 27.7 min (3.4%) (Chiralcel OD,
10% IPA in Hexane, 1 mL/min)
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
