$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of methyl
4-[(2-bromoacetyl)oxy]-2-[(tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino]-5-oxo-5-[(2,4,6-trimethoxybenzyl)amino]pentanoate,
3 [Passerini reaction]: Methyl
2-[(tert-butoxycarbonyl)amino]-4-oxobutanoate 1 and
2-(isocyanomethyl)-1,3,5-trimethoxybenzene 2 were synthesized using a
previously reported method.2 To a solution of 1 (0.5 g, 2.16 mmol) in 5
ml of dry CH2Cl2, bromoacetic acid (0.331 g, 2.38 mmol) was added
followed by the addition of isocyanide 2 (0.493 g, 2.38 mmol). The
reaction mixture was stirred at rt for 2h under Ar. The solvent was
removed and the residue was purified using flash column chromatography
(silica gel, ethyl acetate/n-hexane 40/60) which afforded a
diastereomeric mixture (5.3:4.7) of 3. Pale yellow solid, yield (1.11 g,
89 %) Rf =0.30 (ethyl acetate/n-hexane 4/6). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
6.47-6.44, 6.65-6.62 (m, 1H), 6.11, 6.10 (s, 2H), 5.35 (d, 0.5H, J=8.0
Hz), 5.29-5.27 (m, 0.5H), 5.24 (dd, 0.5H, J=12.0, 4.0 Hz), 5.16 (d, 0.5H,
J=12Hz), 4.57 (dd, 0.5H, J=16, 8.0 Hz), 4.49-4.34 (m, 2.5H), 3.96-3.85,
4.14-4.07 (m, 2H), 3.80 (s, 9H), 3.73, 3.72 (s, 3H), 2.50-2.20 (m, 2H),
1.42, 1.39 (s, 9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 172.5, 172.4, 167.9,
167.6, 166.0, 165.8, 161.2, 159.4, 155.4, 155.2, 105.9, 105.9, 90.6,
80.4, 80.3, 71.9, 71.6, 55.9, 55.5, 52.6, 50.3, 49.8, 40.8, 40.6, 34.8,
34.2, 32.5, 28.4, 25.6, 25.3. ESI-MS: Calculated for C23H33BrN2O10: 577.4
Da [M+], Observed: 597.9 Da [M+Na].
