$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 1-(butylcarbamoyl)-2-(benzyloxy)ethyl benzoate (19)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 14 (45 mg, 0.54
mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (70 mg, 0.57 mmol, 1.05 equiv),
aldehyde 6 (86 mg, 91 μL, 0.57 mmol, 1.05 equiv) and 20 mol % of catalyst
4 in CH2Cl2was stirred for 24 hrs. After removal of solvent followed by
silica gel chromatography, 19 (167 mg, 87%) was obtained as a
brownish-white solid. Data for 19: 1H NMR: (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.13-8.07
(m, 3H, aryl); 7.64-7.60 (m, 1H, aryl); 7.51-7.46 (m, 4H, aryl);
7.30-7.27 (m, 2H, aryl); 6.26 (bt, 1H, NH); 5.61 (t, J = 3.6 Hz, 1H,
CH2); 4.59 (s, 2H, CH2); 4.04-4.00 (dd, J = 4.8, 10.8 Hz, 1H, CH);
3.95-3.91 (dd, J = 3.6, 10.8 Hz, 1H, CH); 3.38-3.26 (m, 2H, CH2);
1.53-1.45 (q, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H, CH2); 1.36-1.27 (m, 2H, CH2); 0.87 (t, J =
7.2 Hz, 3H, CH3) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.0, 165.4, 138.9, 134.0,
130.4, 130.1, 129.5, 128.9, 128.7, 127.9, 73.8, 73.6, 69.7, 39.4, 31.8,
20.2, 13.9 IR: (neat) νmax = 2929, 1724, 1690, 1266, 711 cm-1 TLC: Rf =
0.29 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2) HRMS: EIMS calculated for C21H25NO4+ [M+ H]+:
355.1784, found: 355.1788 HPLC: (+/−)-19 tR 19.3 min (49.2%); tR 23.7 min
(50.8 %) (+)-19 tR 18.9 min (93.8%); tR 23.1 min (6.3%) (Diacel Chiralpak
AS-H 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm, 10% IPA in Hexane, 1 mL/min; isocratic) OR:
[α]D22= + 7.7° (CHCl3, c = 1.05)
