$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of (benzylcarbamoyl)(thiophen-2-yl)methyl benzoate (29)
Following General Procedure II, a mixture of isocyanide 11 (53 mg, 55 μL,
0.45 mmol, 1.0 equiv), benzoic acid (5) (58 mg, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv)
and aldehyde 12 (53 mg, 43 μL, 0.47 mmol, 1.05 equiv) in CH2Cl2 was
stirred for 48 hrs. After removal of solvent and silica gel
chromatography, 29 (137 mg, 87%) was obtained as a whitish-gray solid.
Data for 29: 1H NMR: (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.09-8.06 (dd, J= 1.2, 8.0 Hz,
2H, aryl); 7.62-7.57 (tt, J= 1.2, 7.6 Hz, 1H, aryl); 7.48-7.42 (m, 2H,
aryl); 7.37-7.26 (m, 7H, aryl); 7.03-7.01 (dd, J= 3.2, 5.2 Hz, 1H, aryl);
6.65 (s, 1H, CH); 6.55 (bt, 1H, NH); 4.60-4.55 (dd, J= 6.4, 15.2 Hz, 1H,
CH2); 4.51-4.46 (dd, J= 5.2, 14.4 Hz, 1H, CH2) 13C NMR: (100 MHz, CDCl3)
δ 167.7, 165.2, 137.8, 137.5, 134.0, 130.2, 129.1, 129.0, 128.9, 128.7,
128.2, 127.9, 127.9, 127.2, 72.0, 43.7 IR: (neat) νmax = 3300, 1723,
1667, 1539, 1452, 1264, 1107, 707 cm-1 TLC: Rf = 0.32 (EtOAc:Hex 1:2)
LRMS: EIMS calculated for C20H17NO3S+ [M+ H]+: 352.1, found: 351.1 HPLC:
(+/−)-29 tR 27.1 min (46.5%); tR 30.3 min (53.5 %) (−)-29 tR 27.7 min
(12.7%); tR 30.2 min (87.3%) (Diacel Chiralpak AS-H 0.46 cm φ x 25 cm,
Gradient; t0 10% IPA in Hexane, t10min 12% IPA in Hexane, t20min 14% IPA
in Hexane, t50min 16% IPA in Hexane, t65min 20% IPA in Hexane, 1 mL/min)
OR: [α]D22 = -4.7° (CHCl3, c = 3.4)
