$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ugi product 12b. According to General Procedure I, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 11 (100 mg, 0.22 mmol), paraformaldehyde (10 mg, 0.33
mmol), benzylamine (36 μl, 0.33 mmol) and benzoic acid (29 mg, 0.24
mmol), in MeOH (250 μl) afforded after 22 h 12b (132 mg, 0.19 mmol, 86%)
as a white foam. Column chromatography was performed with c-hexane/EtOAc
7:3→ 6:4 12b, yield (132 mg, 0.19 mmol, 86%) 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO,
403K): δ (ppm) 7.86 (s, 1H), 7.69-7.67 (m, 2H), 7.45-7.23 (m, 19H), 7.06
(d, J= 6.8 Hz, 2H), 7.01-6.99 (m, 2H), 5.70 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.26 (d,
J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 4.28 (d, JAB = 15.6 Hz, 1H), 4.19 (d, JAB = 15.6 Hz, 1H),
4.05 (d, JAB = 17.2 Hz, 1H), 3.92 (d, JAB = 17.2 Hz, 1H), 3.65 (s, 2H),
1.37 (s, 9H); 13C NMR (101 MHz, DMSO, 403K): δ (ppm) 170.6 (C), 168.8
(C), 166.1 (C), 165.5 (C), 139.0 (C), 138.6 (C), 137.0 (C), 135.9 (C),
135.4 (C), 133.9 (C), 128.6 (CH), 128.2 (2 CH), 127.9 (CH), 127.7 (4 CH),
127.6 (2 CH), 127.5 (2 CH), 126.9 (CH), 126.8 (6 CH), 126.5 (4 CH), 125.7
(2 CH), 111.8 (CH), 80.9 (C), 63.3 (C), 49.5 (CH2), 49.4 (CH2), 46.6
(CH2), 41.8 (CH), 27.0 (3 CH3). IR (neat): 3337 (w), 2978 (w), 1742 (m),
1670 (s), 1640 (m), 1495 (m), 1385 (m), 1366 (m), 1227 (m), 1150 (s), 762
(m), 727 (m); 696 (s), 590 (m), 521 (m). HRMS (FAB): calculated for
C45H44N3O5 (MH+) 706.3276, found 706.3287.
