$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Ugi product 12f. According to General Procedure I, reaction between
alkylated DHP-2-one 11 (100 mg, 0.22 mmol), paraformaldehyde (10 mg, 0.33
mmol), n-butylamine (33 μl, 0.33 mmol) and propionic acid (18 μl, 0.24
mmol) in MeOH (250 μl) afforded after 24 h. 12f (120 mg, 0.19 mmol, 86%)
as a white foam. Column chromatography was performed with c-hexane/EtOAc
7:3→ 6:4 12f, yield (120 mg, 0.19 mmol, 86%) 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO,
403K): δ (ppm) 7.75 (bs, 1H), 7.66-7.64 (m, 2H), 7.44-7.38 (m, 2H),
7.35-7.26 (m, 9H), 7.00-6.96 (m, 2H), 5.68 (d, J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 5.20 (d,
J= 7.2 Hz, 1H), 4.04 (d, JAB = 17.0 Hz, 1H), 3.91 (d, JAB = 17.0 Hz, 1H),
3.66 (d, JAB = 16.9 Hz, 1H), 3.63 (d, JAB = 16.9 Hz, 1H), 3.07-2.87 (m,
2H), 2.16-1.90 (m, 2H), 1.36 (s, 9H), 1.31-1.11 (m, 4H), 0.94 (t, J= 7.3
Hz, 3H), 0.83 (t, J= 7.2 Hz, 3H); 13C NMR (101 MHz, DMSO, 403K): δ (ppm)
172.5 (C), 168.9 (C), 166.2 (C), 166.1 (C), 139.0 (C), 138.6 (C), 137.0
(C), 133.9 (C), 128.2 (2 CH), 127.9 (CH), 127.7 (2 CH), 127.5 (2 CH),
126.9 (CH), 126.8 (2 CH), 126.7 (2 CH), 126.5 (3 CH), 111.8 (CH), 80.9
(C), 63.0 (C), 49.8 (CH2), 46.6 (CH2), 46.4 (CH2), 41.58 (CH), 28.9
(CH2), 27.0 (3 CH3), 24.7 (CH2), 18.7 (CH2), 12.5 (CH3), 8.4 (CH3); IR
(neat): 3374 (w), 2934 (w), 1744 (m), 1663 (s), 1495 (m), 1368 (s), 1225
(m), 1152 (s), 762 (m), 698 (s), 590 (m), 519 (m). HRMS (EI, 70 eV):
calculated for C38H45N3O5 (M+) 623.3354, found 623.3344.
