$DATUM 10-(4-(2-((2,6-dimethyl-4-nitrobenzoyl)oxy)butanamido)phenyl)-5,5-difluoro-1,3,7,9-tetramethyl-5H-dipyrrolo[1,2-c:2',1'-f][1,3,2]diazaborinin-4-ium-5-uide
(5). A solution of propionaldehyde (9.38 μL, 0.13 mmol),
2,6-dimethyl-4-nitrobenzoic acid (27.71 mg, 0.14 mmol) and isonitrile 3
(50 mg, 0.14 mmol) in CH2Cl2 (4 mL) was stirred at r.t. for 2 days. When
the reaction was completed, the solvent was removed under pressure and
the reaction crude was purified by flash chromatography (hexane:AcOEt
4:1). 80 mg of compound 5 as an orange solid (85% yield). 1H-NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3): δ 8.00 (s, 1H), 7.90 (s, 2H), 7.69 (d, 2H), 7.23 (d, J= 8
Hz, 2H), 5.97 (s, 2H), 5.45 (t, J= 8Hz, 1H), 2.53 (s, 6H), 2.38 (s, 6H),
2.16 (m, 2H), 1.41 (s, 6H), 1.13 (t, J= 6 Hz, 3H), ppm. 13C-NMR (100 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 167.5, 164.4, 155.5, 154.8, 142.9, 140.9, 137.7, 131.5, 130.3,
130.2, 130.1, 128.8, 121.2, 120.3, 76.4, 29.6, 25.1, 17.3, 14.6, 14.5,
9.6, ppm. 19F-NMR (376 MHz, CDCl3): δ =-146.20 (q, J = 36.0 Hz) ppm. IR
(film) υmax IR (film) υmax: 3385.05, 2962.28, 2923.84, 2853.38, 1732.38,
1693.95, 1604.27, 1546.62, 1501.78, 1463.35, 1309.61, 1187.90, 1155.87,
1085.41, 982.92, 835.59, 758.72, 694.66 cm-1. HRMS: calcd. for
C32H34BF2N4O5, 603.2591 (M+H+); found: 603.2600.
